  3. PATENT NOTICE

  The TIM method, including the selection of adapter placement from the
  overlap between the gradient subspaces of two tasks measured before
  training, is covered by USPTO Patent Application Serial No. 64/121,656,
  filed 29 July 2026. That application was filed covering the development
  of a weight-space regularisation method together with the placement
  procedure evaluated alongside it, and both are within the filing. The
  serial number above is the preliminary number assigned on electronic
  filing and remains subject to the official filing receipt.

